    "x+y=1",
    "y=x",
    "x²−y²=1"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "由 cos²θ+sin²θ=1 得 x²+y²=1。",
   "relatedConceptId": "c01",
   "prerequisites": [
    "ch03"
   ]
